label story_alt_shadow_loss_complete (Shadow Triumphant Complete)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): The shadow from Veld rules more of the night now. I can feel it spreading through root channels that once carried my warmth. But it does not rule your hands.
"Dianthus Core": Three days of resistance are three wounds in its certainty. Three nights it expected to break us and could not.
"Dianthus Core": If this is the shape survival must take, then we will make survival thorned, stubborn, and bright enough to hurt. The dark may own the night, little alchemist — but it will never own the garden.
[signal arg="story_alt_complete:shadow_loss"]
[end_timeline]
